    'market_multiple_targets_v2_headline' => ':count footballers with suitors',
    'market_multiple_targets_v2' => ':count footballers have suitors. The market tests your mettle: selling well is also buying well, but the fans would not forgive a dismantling.',

    'market_window_closing_v1_headline' => 'The market shuts soon: final hours',
    'market_window_closing_v1' => 'The market is about to close — last chance to do business. Phones are ringing off the hook in the offices and last-minute moves are expected. Nobody fall asleep.',
    'market_window_closing_v2_headline' => 'Window closing just around the corner',
    'market_window_closing_v2' => 'The deadline looms. The market closes in a couple of matchdays and there are still open folders on the table. The sporting department are rushing through the final deals.',

    // ── Tournament: Group Stage ──────────────────────────────────────

    'wc_group_opener_v1_headline' => 'World Cup debut: start on the right foot',
    'wc_group_opener_v1' => 'Opening World Cup match. A fine chance to start on the right foot and pile pressure on the rest of the group. Debuts always bring nerves: whoever manages them best will strike first.',
    'wc_group_opener_v2_headline' => 'The tournament begins: three golden points',
    'wc_group_opener_v2' => 'First match of the tournament. Three points here would be a flying start and would completely change the complexion of the group. The preparation has been long: time to prove it.',
    'wc_group_opener_v3_headline' => 'THE CURTAIN RISES',
    'wc_group_opener_v3' => 'The World Cup adventure begins. The dressing room have been dreaming of this moment for months and the whole country grinds to a halt. Let the show begin.',

    'wc_group_must_win_v1_headline' => 'Only a win will do',
    'wc_group_must_win_v1' => 'Final group match. Only a win will do: the maths are clear and there is no plan B. The team will have to gamble from the start, even at the cost of leaving space behind.',
    'wc_group_must_win_v2_headline' => 'Victory required to stay alive',
    'wc_group_must_win_v2' => 'Victory required to keep qualification hopes alive. The pressure is maximum, but these are the matches that forge great national teams.',
    'wc_group_must_win_v3_headline' => 'EARLY FINAL',
    'wc_group_must_win_v3' => 'Without a win, it is bags to the airport. The dressing room knows it and the fans know it too: no speculating today. All out from minute one.',

    'wc_group_top_v1_headline' => 'Group :group leaders',
    'wc_group_top_v1' => 'Group :group leaders. Qualification depends on you: winning today would all but seal top spot. The manager asks for no relaxing.',
    'wc_group_top_v2_headline' => 'On top of Group :group',
    'wc_group_top_v2' => 'On top of Group :group ahead of the next match. The momentum is positive and the dressing room united. Keeping the lead would bring a kinder draw.',
    'wc_group_top_v3_headline' => 'TOP OF THE GROUP',
    'wc_group_top_v3' => 'Top seeds of Group :group. The tournament, for now, is smiling: keep adding points to pick your opponent in the last 16.',

    'wc_group_qualified_v1_headline' => 'Qualified: now for top spot',
    'wc_group_qualified_v1' => 'Already qualified for the knockout stage. Now to claim top spot, which avoids the big guns in the draw. Rotations are expected, but nobody wants to lose momentum.',
    'wc_group_qualified_v2_headline' => 'Ticket stamped: a match to find rhythm',
    'wc_group_qualified_v2' => 'Qualification secured. This match is about finding rhythm and giving minutes to the less regular faces. The goal: reach the last 16 with the whole squad firing.',
    'wc_group_qualified_v3_headline' => 'TICKET STAMPED',
    'wc_group_qualified_v3' => 'Going for top spot in the group. The work well done in the first two matchdays allows this match to be faced without pressure: a luxury at a World Cup.',

    'wc_group_on_brink_v1_headline' => 'Qualification within reach',
    'wc_group_on_brink_v1' => 'Qualification is close. A good result could be enough and the dressing room have been doing the maths for days. Better not to depend on others: seal it today.',
    'wc_group_on_brink_v2_headline' => 'A point could be enough',
    'wc_group_on_brink_v2' => 'Close to the knockout stage. A point today could seal it, but playing for a draw usually backfires. The plan: play to win, as always.',
    'wc_group_on_brink_v3_headline' => 'ONE STEP AWAY',
    'wc_group_on_brink_v3' => 'A draw could be enough to go through. The calculators are smoking in the stands, but on the pitch only one thing counts: competing.',

    'wc_group_eliminated_v1_headline' => 'Last dance at the tournament',
    'wc_group_eliminated_v1' => 'Qualification is no longer possible. One last match remains to be played with dignity and to say goodbye to the tournament with heads held high. The youngsters will get minutes.',
    'wc_group_eliminated_v2_headline' => 'Close out the group stage with honour',
    'wc_group_eliminated_v2' => 'Out of the race, but one match remains to close out the group stage. Pride is at stake and the manager wants to see character.',
    'wc_group_eliminated_v3_headline' => 'THE DREAM IS OVER',
    'wc_group_eliminated_v3' => 'Last dance in the group stage. The tournament has not gone as hoped, but the shirt is defended to the end.',

    'wc_group_gd_v1_headline' => 'Goal difference could decide it',
    'wc_group_gd_v1' => 'Goal difference could prove decisive. A very tight group where every goal counts double. The manager has already warned: if you can, go for the big win.',
    'wc_group_gd_v2_headline' => 'Tight group: every goal counts',
    'wc_group_gd_v2' => 'Tight group. Goal difference may end up separating the teams, so there is no easing off even with the match won.',
    'wc_group_gd_v3_headline' => 'CALCULATORS OUT',
    'wc_group_gd_v3' => 'Goal difference could decide the group. Points ties are broken by goals: every strike could be worth a qualification.',

    // ── Tournament: Knockout Stage ───────────────────────────────────

    'wc_knockout_r32_v1_headline' => 'Last 32: no margin for error',
    'wc_knockout_r32_v1' => 'Last 32. Straight knockout, no margin for error: one bad day and it is home time. The tension is palpable from the anthem onwards.',
    'wc_knockout_r32_v2_headline' => 'The serious stuff starts: win or go home',
    'wc_knockout_r32_v2' => 'The knockout stage begins. A defeat here ends the tournament, so the approach will be one of maximum caution. Details decide.',
    'wc_knockout_r32_v3_headline' => 'DO OR DIE',
    'wc_knockout_r32_v3' => 'The straight knockout stage begins. Ninety minutes — or one hundred and twenty — to keep dreaming. There is no tomorrow.',

    'wc_knockout_r16_v1_headline' => 'Last 16: 16 remain',
    'wc_knockout_r16_v1' => 'Last 16. Sixteen national teams remain in the competition and the level is already sky-high. Surviving here is what the great teams do.',
    'wc_knockout_r16_v2_headline' => 'Among the last 16 in the world',
    'wc_knockout_r16_v2' => 'Among the last 16. The level of opposition rises from here and any lapse is paid for dearly. Experience in these fixtures will be key.',
    'wc_knockout_r16_v3_headline' => '16 REMAIN',
    'wc_knockout_r16_v3' => 'World Cup last 16. The tournament narrows and only the best survive.',

    'wc_knockout_qf_v1_headline' => 'Quarter-finals: three matches from the title',
    'wc_knockout_qf_v1' => 'You have reached the quarter-finals. Only three matches separate you from the world title. The dressing room know it and the excitement is overflowing, but the hardest part is still to come.',
    'wc_knockout_qf_v2_headline' => 'Among the best eight: a semi-final at stake',
    'wc_knockout_qf_v2' => 'Among the best eight. A place in the semi-finals at stake, where history already waits. The opposition are among the scary ones, but at this stage they all are.',
    'wc_knockout_qf_v3_headline' => 'ELITE TERRITORY',
    'wc_knockout_qf_v3' => 'Only eight national teams remain in the tournament. Every match from here on is an early final.',

    'wc_knockout_sf_v1_headline' => 'Semi-final: win and you play the final',
    'wc_knockout_sf_v1' => 'Semi-final. Winning today means playing the World Cup final. The country grinds to a halt and the dressing room have been preparing this moment their whole lives. Steady nerves now.',
    'wc_knockout_sf_v2_headline' => 'One match from the final',
    'wc_knockout_sf_v2' => 'One match from the final. The most important match of the tournament so far, with permission from whatever comes next. Emotional management will be decisive.',
    'wc_knockout_sf_v3_headline' => 'ON THE BRINK OF THE FINAL',
    'wc_knockout_sf_v3' => 'Ninety minutes to make history. The final is so close you can almost touch it.',

    'wc_knockout_third_v1_headline' => 'Bronze on the line',
    'wc_knockout_third_v1' => 'Third-place play-off. There is still a medal at stake and the pride of finishing the tournament on the podium. It hurts not to be in the final, but a medal is forever.',
    'wc_knockout_third_v2_headline' => 'Going for bronze with heads held high',
    'wc_knockout_third_v2' => 'The bronze-medal match. A chance to end on a positive note a tournament that left a bitter taste. The manager will give minutes to those who have played least.',
    'wc_knockout_third_v3_headline' => 'THE CONSOLATION PRIZE',
    'wc_knockout_third_v3' => 'But a medal is a medal. Third place is celebrated less, but remembered forever.',

    'wc_knockout_final_v1_headline' => 'THE WORLD CUP FINAL',
    'wc_knockout_final_v1' => 'The World Cup final. The last match of the tournament, the one the whole planet will watch. Ninety minutes for immortality: the champions’ names are remembered forever.',
    'wc_knockout_final_v2_headline' => 'One match to crown the champions',
    'wc_knockout_final_v2' => 'The final. One match to crown the world champions. Everything before — years of work, of sacrifice — leads to this night.',
    'wc_knockout_final_v3_headline' => 'THE MATCH',
    'wc_knockout_final_v3' => 'The final of the world. No words left: it only remains to play it.',

